  "project_description": "aMap (Ajax Map) provides a single block plugin that embeds an inline SVG map (a bundled map of the USA) and, via a small client-side jQuery behavior, fetches JSON from an administrator-configured URL and recolors, styles, and links the SVG's regions from that data. It is a display-only site-builder tool: it ships no entities, permissions, routes, services, or config schema, and depends only on core node and block.",
